{"id":"417d00d488dc3da6","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md","title":"Smullyan Diagonal Theorem","display":"thm-smullyan-diagonal — Smullyan Diagonal Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-smullyan-diagonal","aliases":["90-thm-smullyan-diagonal"],"display":"thm-smullyan-diagonal — Smullyan Diagonal Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-smullyan-diagonal]]","[[90-df-norm]]","[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-smullyan-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-smullyan-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-diagonal — Smullyan Diagonal Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb8a113c2891ff19\" href=\"?note=fb8a113c2891ff19\" title=\"90-df-smullyan-diagonal\">90-df-smullyan-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"72adf94db165e486\" href=\"?note=72adf94db165e486\" title=\"90-df-norm\">90-df-norm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (effective arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (one-free-variable formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=g(\\varphi(v))\">\\(e=g(\\varphi(v))\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,e)\\)</span> (Smullyan diagonal map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 必须是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 时固定的指定变量；这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\)</span> 实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d,S\">\\(g,d,S\\)</span> 也保持同一环境，不更换替换变量后仍沿用原函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)\n=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,e)\n=g\\bigl(\\varphi[\\overline e/v]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)\n=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,e)\n=g\\bigl(\\varphi[\\overline e/v]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smullyan 的 norm/diagonal 记法封装了自代入，但并没有消除底层编码替换。</li>\n<li>结论是编码恒等式；任意公式的不动点还需把该恒等式用于专门构造的辅助公式。</li>\n<li>编码、部分解码器与替换函数必须来自同一有效 Gödel 编号上下文。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-smullyan-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"fb8a113c2891ff19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-smullyan-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-norm","status":"resolved","id":"72adf94db165e486","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-norm]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":